 13. 
.                         *Keep relevant
.                         keep conm gvkey permno sic PDstocks AR CAR sumAR sumR
>  ret alpha panel description Et  Ft ///
>                                 mdy *size* *leverage* *profitability* expo* q
> 75* q50 q25 n state sumiVol* ///
>                                 alpha b_mkt b_smb b_hml b_umd any* cusip tic 
> cik conm ret exre ivol tvol r2 mofd *expo* busdesc PRisk-Sentiment mdy_earnca
> ll mkvalt*
 14. 
.                         *Save
.                         save "$path_cleaned/panel`v'.dta",replace
 15.                 restore
 16.         }
