> 75* n state sumiVol* ///
>                                 alpha any* cusip tic cik conm ret exre ivol t
> vol r2 mofd *expo* busdesc PRisk-Sentiment mdy_earncall mkvalt*
 12. 
.                         *Save
.                         save "$path_cleaned/panel`v'.dta",replace
 13.                 restore
 14.         }
