. *2) Descriptives for RAW monthly data
. *****************************************************************************
> ***                                
. use "$path_cleaned/final_monthly.dta",clear

.         *Collapse
.          collapse (mean) alpha exret ret b_* ivol tvol r2 , by(group mofd) 

.          sort group mofd

.          drop if exret==.
